    "body": "If you haven’t already, check out our [contributing guidelines](https://github.com/Expensify/ReactNativeChat/blob/main/contributingGuides/CONTRIBUTING.md) for onboarding. To join our Slack channel, fill out [this form](https://forms.gle/Q7hnhUJPnQCK7Fe56).\n___\n\n**Version Number:** v9.5.24-2\n**Reproducible in staging?:** Yes\n**Reproducible in production?:** Yes\n**If this was caught during regression testing, add the test name, ID and link from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/104671\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** leungbratt6+2210@gmail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Pull Request QA execution\n**Device used:** Windows 11/Chrome\n**App Component:** Left Hand Navigation (LHN)\n\n## Action Performed:\nPreconditions: The user has a Workspace with a Business Band Account and a Personal BA to withdraw\n1. Open the New Dot app\n2. Navigate to an approved report in Workspace chat\n3. Pay it with the Business Band Account\n4. Go to the Spend tab - Reports -Column - Select Withdrawal ID\n\n## Expected Result:\nA Withdrawal ID appears in the paid report\n\n## Actual Result:\nBlank at the Withdrawal ID (recheck the same paid report after 12hours, still blank)\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d20c1fbe-ab87-4bd6-899d-76de769955d2\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Chandana Kiran\n> Bug ID: 7298423\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022115275697924542772\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~0221152756979